SIXTH PILLAR STUDENTS 
What tradition the Sixth Pillar Students are 
intended to cast from is unclear, as they have a 
Primal bloodline but are listed as casting Arcane 
spells, and they have a few spells that appear on 
the Arcane list but not the Primal list or appear on 
the Primal list but not the Arcane list. You might 
feel that this undercuts the Speakers to the Winds’ 
halcyon magic, so two alternate spell lists are 
included, one which uses only Primal and 
elemental bloodline spells, and one which uses 
only Arcane and draconic bloodline spells. If you 
want a wider variety of spells in the fight, use two 
of both.  
