ALTERNATE SPELLS 
Given that Razu’s mission involves a great deal of 
deception and misdirection, it makes sense that 
many of his spells are primarily useful out of 
combat, and I recommended that you use the 
above list. Try to give players opportunities to see 
him use these spells in the chase, since spells that 
they never see him use may as well not exist to the 
players. That said, if you still prefer for Razu to be 
able to use his full possible array of spells in a 
fight, a combat focused selection is provided.  
